      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Related to what I proposed here:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/avatar-policy-in-sdk-and-clients\n\nDeclaring your intention as an author is needed to detect violations in the first place. Because not every situation would be considered malicious or stealing.",
